# .github/ci-tools.env — the external tools the `integration` CI job installs, at their pins, with the digest
# each download must have (leaf `PROGRAM.10.4`). Read by `scripts/ci_provision.sh`. Every `*_VERSION_PINNED`
# is a pin `SOURCE-LEDGER` holds to its entry in `docs/book/src/ledger.md`.
#
# QEMU's *release* is pinned where the target's contract is, `targets/riscv-virt-up.env`; only the digest of
# its source tarball is here, with the release that digest belongs to, so a pin that moves without a new
# digest is refused rather than built.
#
# Retrieved `2026-09-30`. mdBook's digests agree with the ones GitHub publishes for the release assets; QEMU's
# is the tarball as served over HTTPS by download.qemu.org, its GPG signature not checked.
#
# Shell-sourceable KEY=VALUE. No command substitution, no interpolation.

MDBOOK_VERSION_PINNED=0.5.2
MDBOOK_SHA256_LINUX_X86_64=084e4342ba564db270108763e404a7d1f309d932651a22484e93c0dc1a071f6d
MDBOOK_SHA256_DARWIN_ARM64=da2f55653e96e3f6e1c53e2e13e91cc0cfbce8ab971c2e0de792c0f1f8d24222

QEMU_SOURCE_RELEASE=11.1.1
QEMU_SOURCE_SHA256=079ffbff8a7111bbc89022107cbabf3bbfd614d5fc9d7cc675991196aca12482
